Tools available:
- bash: Execute a bash command in the trading operations workstation shell. Returns stdout and stderr. Commands time out after 60 seconds. parameters: {"type": "object", "properties": {"command": {"type": "string", "description": "The bash command to execute"}}, "required": ["command"]}
